, "screenshots": [{"id": 1990779, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16o3f.jpg"}, {"id": 1990781, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16o3h.jpg"}, {"id": 1990782, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16o3i.jpg"}, {"id": 1990780, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16o3g.jpg"}], "slug": "pirates-split-the-treasure", "storyline": "Five pirates stand around one chest of gold, and the highest-ranked among them has to propose how to divide it. The others have seconds to reject the offer, and silence counts as yes. Greed pays only if the vote lets it, because a rejected proposer is out of the match and leaves part of their coins in the chest for the next pirate in line.", "summary": "One chest of coins, five pirates, and a split that has to survive a vote.\n\nThe highest-level pirate proposes how the treasure is divided - generous, greedy, or anything in between. Everyone else has seconds to reject the offer. Say nothing and it passes.\n\nWhen a split passes, the match ends and the coins are paid out. When enough voters reject, the proposer is out of the match, part of their coins is forfeited into the treasure, and the next pirate proposes a split of a bigger chest among fewer pirates.\n\nRich one match, broke the next. Live multiplayer, seconds per match, and another five pirates are always gathering around a chest.\n\nA free-to-play, real-time social strategy game.", "themes": [{"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pirates-split-the-treasure", "videos": [{"id": 202673, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "IyYyADcRIOU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IyYyADcRIOU", "title": "Pirates: Split the Treasure gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IyYyADcRIOU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 203422, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "Pc6u13Mehik", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pc6u13Mehik", "title": "Pirates: Split the Treasure", "thumb": "https://i.y